WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Ice order generation

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,140
Golden and crispy pork ribs

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,140
And fresh vegetables

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,200
Am I not dreaming?

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,200
Are you hungry?

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,200
You eat first

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,200
I'll go shopping in front

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,200
I'm not hungry. You should eat everything.

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,200
Don't waste

10
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,200
If you don't have enough rice, call me again

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:26,140
It’s actually meat

12
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,140
No negative reaction from the body

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:38,180
Then I'll start

14
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,180
It's made in a hotel, right?

15
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,180
I have never eaten it again in my life

16
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,180
Such delicious ribs
